   "email": "person",
   "message": "SEB-268: finding page rebuilt to the approved reference (#464)\n\nTop: back link and the 01 to 04 pills 24px below the header line. Hero: title, claim, the headline number at 36px with its unit on one line, then 'Rechecked ... UTC' in grey; the 480px gap and right column are gone. One chart per finding, each with hover and tap through the shared tooltip, the day picked from where the pointer is along the chart: 01 rises above and cuts below the line by day with a route filter, 02 one bar per Saturday from the first counted one to the last whose Tuesday is in the data with 0 shown as 0, 03 stablecoin cost on S$5,000 against monthly volume on a log scale with the cheapest app dashed and the crossing marked, buying now and waiting for your price switch the curve, 04 the extra cost against the cheapest app hour by hour with dots on the hours it won. Evidence as plain rows with route names in full; finding 03 in S$ on S$5,000 with no Australian dollar row. Download shows the real file size (68 KB). Other findings are plain rows. Computed at render time from data/findings.json, the finding's findings_hours CSV and data/volume_crossover.json. The tooltip keeps what a chart just showed (js/tooltip.js) and shows line breaks. The new words are in #463.\n\nCo-authored-by: Sebastian Roervig <sebastian.roervig@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
