   "message": "SEB-268: home rebuilt to the approved reference (#462)\n\n* home rebuild WIP\n\n* SEB-268: home rebuilt to the approved reference\n\nIntro (headline, what we price, routes, the AI agents line with a link to how it was built, one line of totals); the big 88% block, the 9-row legend, the Paying most column, Play, the slider and the counters are gone. Map: country names sorted by this hour's figure, the last 30 days with 'Show earlier days', the key on one line above it, this hour's figure or 'no price' on the right, hover and tap on a square (the day comes from where the pointer is along the row) giving country, day and figure through the shared tooltip, today's square also giving the price line, names open the country page. Movers by country name with '+3.3 points this week', each row linking to its country. Four findings linking to their pages, the fourth computed from data/findings.json (never says a stablecoin never won). The record chart is the SEB-278 block: dark dots for routes, open dots for sources, no label lanes. Rendered, design, style, copy and inventory checks pass; checked in the browser at 1300px and 390px. The new words are in #461.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Sebastian Roervig <sebastian.roervig@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
